<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>发起人认证 - 开发中</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="common.css">
    <style>
        .page-content {
            height: calc(100% - 44px);
            background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 40px 24px;
        }

        .dev-indicator {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .dev-icon {
            width: 100px;
            height: 100px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF7E6 0%, #FFE7BA 100%);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 48px;
        }

        .dev-title {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .dev-desc {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-tertiary);
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .dev-progress {
            margin-top: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            color: var(--warning-color);
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .dev-progress .dot {
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
            background-color: var(--warning-color);
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: pulse 1.4s infinite ease-in-out;
        }

        .dev-progress .dot:nth-child(2) {
            animation-delay: 0.2s;
        }

        .dev-progress .dot:nth-child(3) {
            animation-delay: 0.4s;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 80%, 100% {
                transform: scale(0.6);
                opacity: 0.5;
            }
            40% {
                transform: scale(1);
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }
    </style>
<style>
    /* v2-native-capsule-style：微信原生胶囊占位（不可自定义，仅演示位置） */
    .nav-bar .native-capsule {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 5px;
        min-width: 46px;
        height: 28px;
        padding: 0 8px;
        border: 1px dashed #cfcfcf;
        border-radius: 14px;
        color: #b3b3b3;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1;
        user-select: none;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="phone-frame">
        <div class="status-bar">
            <div class="time">9:41</div>
            <div class="icons">📶 🔋</div>
        </div>

        <div class="nav-bar">
            <div class="back" onclick="history.back()">← 返回</div>
            <div class="title centered">发起人认证</div>
            
        
            <div class="actions"><div class="native-capsule" title="微信原生胶囊：由微信客户端渲染，开发者不可自定义其内容"></div></div>
        </div>
            


        <div class="page-content">
            <div class="dev-indicator">
                <div class="dev-icon">🔧</div>
                <div class="dev-title">功能开发中</div>
                <div class="dev-desc">
                    发起人认证功能正在紧张开发中<br>
                    敬请期待，上线后即可享受项目分利权益
                </div>
                <div class="dev-progress">
                    <span>开发中</span>
                    <span class="dot"></span>
                    <span class="dot"></span>
                    <span class="dot"></span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page-nav">
        <div class="page-nav-title">原型导航</div>
        <a href="home.html" class="page-nav-item">首页</a>
        <a href="project-list.html" class="page-nav-item">项目列表</a>
        <a href="create-project.html" class="page-nav-item">创建项目</a>
        <a href="promoter-auth.html" class="page-nav-item active">发起人认证</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>